	desc:
		'''
		All plants in Smrtec are highly GMO, created as part of terraforming and colonizing this moon. They grow absurdly quickly due to exposure with Life Essence.

		With any wrench, you can plant seeds into the ground. Eventually, they'll grow into a full-sized plant ready to be harvested.

		Plants may provide money or resources for chemistry, cooking, and construction.

		Seeds can be bought at a market, or obtained by harvesting plants.
		'''
	
